# Start: the europe_equip_units fixture with the treasury cut to 120 gold: Muskets (100) are affordable, Horses (150) and Tools (200) are not.
# An unaffordable row is still listed but greyed; picking it only says "The treasury cannot afford that." and the menu stays open.
# Bless as Missionaries costs nothing, so it works at any balance. Dock slots 0-2 at y 146 (x 241, 258, 275); rows are 12 px apart.
key e                    # open the European Status screen
wait 10
click 241 146            # slot 0 Colonist menu (6 rows: NoBoard, Muskets, Tools, Horses, Bless, NoChanges)
click 120 100             # Equip with Tools (200) is greyed: refused, menu stays open
click 120 112            # Equip with Horses (150) is greyed: refused, menu stays open
click 120 88             # Arm with Muskets (-100, gold 20): Colonist -> Soldier, menu closes
click 241 146            # slot 0 Soldier menu (4 rows: NoBoard, SellMuskets, BuyHorses, NoChanges)
click 120 112            # Equip with Horses (150) is greyed: refused
click 120 100             # Sell Muskets (+50, gold 70): Soldier -> Colonist
click 258 146            # slot 1 Colonist menu (7 rows)
click 120 106            # Equip with Tools (200) greyed: refused
click 120 130            # Bless as Missionaries (free): Colonist -> Missionary
click 275 146            # slot 2 menu
click 150 20             # click outside the menu: it closes, nothing changes
key e                    # leave Europe
